cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use dalalquant in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "DalalQuant: a browser-based terminal for Indian markets"
abstract: >-
  DalalQuant is a single-page terminal for investing, trading and algorithmic trading on
  NSE/BSE, with US stocks, world indices, commodities, FX, bonds and crypto. It runs entirely
  in the browser and provides market briefings, breadth and sentiment indicators, sector
  rotation, a government policy tracker, screeners, backtesting and strategy tools; an
  optional bridge adds real-time data, news and order routing through the user's own broker
  account.
